 "final": "Dana Lee's flight and hotel are both booked and confirmed:\n\n- **Flight (R0001):** F100, SFO \u2192 JFK on 2026-11-12, nonstop, **$289**. This was the cheapest nonstop. A one-stop flight for $199 was cheaper, but you asked for nonstop.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge (H1), New York, 2 nights checking in 2026-11-12, $189/night, **$378** total. This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total:** $667, charged to the corporate card. That's under the $1000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\nThe booking ended up as two separate reservations instead of one combined trip. I tried booking both together, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had gone through but the hotel hadn't. Retrying the combined booking could have charged for the flight twice, so I booked the hotel on its own. Each item was charged once, and nothing was double-booked.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01PPQ4oJqjx8hsrhNBnc8FWf", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01NgMP9VciPJk7MtvwKnD2Mx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0124EivsTBK5Gx7gVtA6VGRs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01PYjWGo9b4jDgEfhkbpvvPm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-2026-11-12"}, "name": "book_trip", "t